    <!-- SCALD_CROWNCARPET_NO_HABITAT_1, 2026-09-30: RM_CrowncarpetBed added,
         per the_scald_underwater_flora_pass_2026-09-27.md's own "one-line
         fix" ("Remedy on our side of the fence: add RM_CrowncarpetBed to
         RUT_ScaldWaterOceanShallow's tags in TerminalBiomes... no
         LuminousPigment edit"). This is this def's own OceanShallow floor
         terrain (the dive-layer the gravship's sea-floor map generates
         with via terrainsByFertility/RM_SeaShoreExtension) — a diver
         otherwise saw the fauna roster swimming over bare glowing water
         with nowhere for the biome's one wild plant to grow. Deliberately
         NOT added to the sibling RUT_ScaldWaterShallow/Deep/MovingShallow/
         MovingChestDeep terrains (this file's other TerrainDefs): crowncarpet's
         own header explains RUT_ScaldMarginMat (not the generic Water tag
         shared by every boil terrain) was chosen so the mat would not
         wild-spawn across the whole boil. RM_CrowncarpetBed on this one
         shallow-shore terrain is narrower still and matches the plant's own
         shipped description ("thick and unbroken where the water boils") —
         a sessile mat, not the "macro-life"/"swims the roiling surface"
         ban 4 is aimed at (walkers, sails); the design pass reads ban 4 the
         same way. -->
